        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofbrookston.com/about-us",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Brookston became an incorporated town in 1867, solidifying its local government and civic identity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brookston%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Brookston post office has been operating continuously since the town was first platted, serving residents for over a century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
